    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "898f305c5b03b1d4",
      "translationZh": "访问 Google Cloud Console，在你的项目下点击创建虚拟机。按照以下步骤创建一个配备 176 个 vCPU 的实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
