    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "834e05881826b09d",
      "translationZh": "每个 vCPU 的归一化吞吐量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de68850dbfab03e1",
      "translationZh": "在最大为 64 的各个批次大小下，搭载 Intel Xeon 6 处理器的 C4 始终优于 C3，每个 vCPU 的吞吐量为 C3 的 1.4x 至 1.7×。公式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2dff128d7dfed42f",
      "translationZh": "成本与总拥有成本（TCO）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d7ef8f1b9cae41f",
      "translationZh": "在批大小为 64 时，C4 的每 vCPU 吞吐量是 C3 的 1.7 倍；由于两者的每 vCPU 价格几乎相同（每小时成本随 vCPU 数量线性增长），这带来了 1.7 倍的 TCO 优势（要生成相同数量的 token，C3 所需的支出是 C4 的 1.7 倍）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d327a6ca3a87df0a",
      "translationZh": "每 vCPU 吞吐量比值：throughput_C4/vCPUs_C4throughput_C3/vCPUs_C3=1.7⇒TCO_C3TCO_C4≈1.7 \\frac{\\text{throughput\\_C4} / \\text{vCPUs\\_C4}}{\\text{throughput\\_C3} / \\text{vCPUs\\_C3}} = 1.7 \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\text{TCO\\_C3}}{\\text{TCO\\_C4}} \\approx 1.7 throughput_C3/vCPUs_C3throughput_C4/vCPUs_C4​=1.7⇒TCO_C4TCO_C3​≈1.7",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "455eded4ac843c24",
      "translationZh": "与上一代 Google Cloud C3 VM（搭载第 4 代 Intel Xeon 处理器）相比，搭载 Intel Xeon 6 处理器（GNR）的 Google Cloud C4 VM 在大型 MoE 推理中既实现了显著的性能提升，也提供了更高的成本效益。在 GPT OSS MoE 推理中，我们观察到吞吐量提高、延迟降低和成本减少同时实现。这些结果表明，得益于 Intel 和 Hugging Face 对框架进行的针对性优化，大型 MoE 模型能够在下一代通用 CPU 上高效提供推理服务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
